  "reply": "1. Open **Patient Portal > Form Builder**.\n2. Create or edit your form, then click **Save Draft**.\n3. Choose **Publish to Portal**.\n4. Go to **Patient Portal > Settings** and assign the published form to the desired appointment types. Ensure all required fields pass validation and patients have active portal accounts."
